  Patched:
    tools/patches/ffc/0001-add-linkage-macros.patch adds FFC_LINKAGE and
      FFC_LINKAGE_EXTERN so that every public function can be made static;
    tools/patches/ffc/0002-drop-float-equal-pragmas.patch removes the
      pragmas that silence -Wfloat-equal, which R CMD check reports;
    tools/patches/ffc/0003-u64-overflow-at-max-digits.patch rejects
